  "objective": "Predict pediatric alfentanil plasma concentration-time profiles by scaling a PBPK model to children using age-appropriate body physiology and enzyme ontogeny. This is an extrapolation task: use the same drug properties as in adults and do NOT estimate any parameters from the pediatric data. The pediatric observed data is the target to reproduce, not to fit.",
